{"version":1,"content":"<p>黃仁勳辭去英偉達CEO、董事職務的消息發酵後，公司內部出現大規模挽留聲音，同時總部外也出現致敬一幕。據外媒Wired報道，英偉達內網意見箱一條相關帖子已經積累超1600條評論，多數員工表態支持黃仁勳留任。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586262.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.760379+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:02:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888421+00:00","content_hash":"df7683d5c5af021254eb854e0df9e53eb163181e30b78a107403c79d94a9ffe4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}